WEBVTT

00:11.886 --> 00:18.685
Though wise, working under us in battle
Oh no, as tragedy is written

00:18.768 --> 00:22.647
The loving son never falters

00:22.731 --> 00:26.609
And sees only passion
Of the soul as precious

00:26.693 --> 00:28.445
Farewell friend and loved one

00:28.528 --> 00:33.950
May you not rest in peace
But instead as the candle in the wind

00:34.034 --> 00:39.873
Taking hold of the strained dark soils
To unleash as a rainbow

00:45.628 --> 00:47.130
A waste of time.

00:50.383 --> 00:56.431
Though wise, working under us in battle
Oh no, as tragedy is written

00:56.514 --> 00:59.726
The loving son never falters

00:59.809 --> 01:03.229
And sees only passion
Of the soul as precious

01:03.313 --> 01:05.106
Farewell friend and loved one

01:05.190 --> 01:10.195
May you not rest in peace
But instead as the candle in the wind

01:10.278 --> 01:14.824
Taking hold of the strained dark soils
To unleash as a rainbow

01:21.498 --> 01:22.373
A waste of time!

02:53.548 --> 02:55.717
Time to eat!

03:04.267 --> 03:05.852
Delish!

03:05.935 --> 03:08.730
So, why didn't you call me for this one?

03:08.813 --> 03:10.273
I'm the leader, you know!

03:10.356 --> 03:14.068
Why the hell are you here?
You didn't work, so you can't eat!

03:14.152 --> 03:16.362
What happened to the Rokken Sect?

03:16.446 --> 03:19.616
I haven't contacted them
at all recently, so I don't know.

03:23.995 --> 03:25.496
Milk is tasty, deez.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.165
I'm glad, deez.

03:27.248 --> 03:28.958
Am I allowed to eat, too?

03:29.042 --> 03:31.419
More like, why are you back?

03:31.502 --> 03:34.172
I told you to never
come back to Earth again!

03:36.466 --> 03:39.385
I was grateful
when I was given a cow, deez.

03:40.720 --> 03:45.934
but it didn't produce any milk,
so I didn't have a choice but to return.

03:46.434 --> 03:48.811
Besides, our [@@@@] is filled

03:48.895 --> 03:54.609
with a watery substance called [L@@]
that sends oxygen directly to our lungs.

03:54.692 --> 03:56.778
- What?
- So it's difficult to milk the cow.

03:56.861 --> 03:59.697
What? You breathe with your lungs,
but you live underwater?

03:59.781 --> 04:05.036
But Chiquitita can't survive unless
he constantly drinks milk, deez.

04:05.119 --> 04:08.248
And so we decided to live on Earth, deez.

04:08.331 --> 04:10.792
Um! Directly sending oxygen to the lungs?

04:10.875 --> 04:13.002
You live on
a perfluorocarbon-based planet?

04:13.086 --> 04:15.588
We can't stay here, deez?

04:15.672 --> 04:19.509
That's not true. You can stay here
as long as you want.

04:19.592 --> 04:20.969
They're no good.

04:21.719 --> 04:23.721
They've gotten too old.

04:23.805 --> 04:27.100
If so, I can't arrange
for a hayashi performance right now.

04:27.183 --> 04:28.851
We have no choice.

04:28.935 --> 04:32.438
I feel sorry for Jiji, but I guess
he'll stay like that for a while.

04:32.522 --> 04:36.276
Even if we had a hayashi performance,
could we fully exorcise it?

04:36.359 --> 04:38.528
It's one thing if it's only Evil Eye.

04:38.611 --> 04:42.282
But his spiritual power is too strong,
I don't know if we can separate them.

04:42.365 --> 04:46.953
Even if we could, Mr. Jiji might be left
with some lasting effects.

04:50.957 --> 04:52.333
Hot!

04:52.417 --> 04:54.377
What the hell are you doing?

04:54.460 --> 04:56.921
- Don't waste food!
- Hot!

04:57.005 --> 04:58.298
Wait, hold up!

04:58.381 --> 05:00.800
It's pitch black! Where is everyone?

05:00.883 --> 05:02.218
Where is this place?

05:02.302 --> 05:04.679
Come on, Taro. Are you messing around?

05:04.762 --> 05:06.514
It's not me!

05:06.597 --> 05:08.224
Momo? Are you there?

05:08.308 --> 05:09.225
Jiji?

05:09.809 --> 05:10.852
Jiji, are you back?

05:10.935 --> 05:11.769
Momo?

05:11.853 --> 05:12.854
Wait!

05:12.937 --> 05:15.648
Evil spirits use
people's voices to trick you.

05:15.732 --> 05:17.984
Don't release the seal yet.

05:19.736 --> 05:21.279
Taro, open up your face.

05:21.362 --> 05:23.072
Slowly.

05:28.369 --> 05:29.537
Which is it?

05:29.620 --> 05:31.831
I can't tell because
he's making a weird face.

05:31.914 --> 05:32.749
Mr. Jiji?

05:32.832 --> 05:35.418
Momo! Okarun! You're okay?

05:35.501 --> 05:36.544
I'm so glad!

05:36.627 --> 05:38.296
I was super worried about you!

05:38.379 --> 05:40.423
Auntie is here, too. I'm so glad!

05:40.506 --> 05:42.467
You're as beautiful as ever!

05:42.550 --> 05:44.552
Looks like he's the real deal.

05:44.635 --> 05:46.596
Grandma, what does this all mean?

05:46.679 --> 05:48.556
Momo, fetch me some cold water.

05:53.436 --> 05:56.981
Bastards. I'll kill you all!

06:03.529 --> 06:04.864
Ow! Hot!

06:04.947 --> 06:06.908
Hold on, what? The heck?

06:06.991 --> 06:08.367
I see.

06:08.451 --> 06:10.745
This is pretty troublesome.

06:17.210 --> 06:19.670
In other words... What?

06:29.931 --> 06:32.517
When you splash him with cold water,
he's Evil Eye.

06:32.600 --> 06:35.228
And when it's hot water,
he goes back to Jiji?

06:39.107 --> 06:40.274
Huh?

06:40.358 --> 06:41.734
Ow!

06:41.818 --> 06:44.904
Hold on a sec!
I'm the one who's feeling the pain!

06:44.987 --> 06:48.157
- How long do I have to lend my body?
- Stop fooling around!

06:48.241 --> 06:51.160
I can't be lovey-dovey
with Hana like this!

06:51.244 --> 06:52.495
Sorry!

06:52.578 --> 06:54.789
I'm not letting you see Hana for a while.

06:54.872 --> 06:57.125
What?! Ms. Seiko! Why is that?

06:57.208 --> 07:00.294
To begin with, our curfew is ten o'clock.

07:00.378 --> 07:03.548
I don't wanna let Hana
see some weird guy late at night.

07:03.631 --> 07:05.675
Ten o'clock is way too early!

07:05.758 --> 07:08.886
More importantly, Jiji, I'm sorry.

07:08.970 --> 07:10.430
You too, Momo and Four-Eyes.

07:11.139 --> 07:15.309
If I knew Evil Eye was there,
I wouldn't have let you go by yourselves.

07:15.393 --> 07:17.019
This is my responsibility.

07:18.604 --> 07:19.522
I'm sorry.

07:19.605 --> 07:21.816
Hey, quit it. It's not like you.

07:21.899 --> 07:24.318
I asked you for help,
so please don't apologize.

07:25.278 --> 07:27.321
Sheesh, you guys are all softies.

07:27.405 --> 07:30.825
You really think
you can keep Evil Eye in check?

07:30.908 --> 07:33.494
Evil Eye was originally a mountain spirit.

07:33.578 --> 07:37.999
Mountain spirits are at the level
of being revered as gods.

07:39.667 --> 07:42.837
If an ordinary human were
to get possessed, they'd go insane.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.922
Their cells would break down,
and they'd die.

07:45.506 --> 07:49.886
That's why they only go after humans
with high spiritual power.

07:59.437 --> 08:03.691
In that respect, he's the ultimate vessel.

08:03.774 --> 08:07.361
Evil Eye is like a newborn baby right now.

08:07.445 --> 08:09.655
We happened to escape
from danger this time,

08:10.239 --> 08:12.241
but he's only going to get stronger.

08:12.325 --> 08:15.036
Eventually, you won't be able
to hold him back.

08:15.119 --> 08:19.749
For now, Jiji, make sure to stay
within sight of someone at all times.

08:19.832 --> 08:21.918
I'll have Manjiro watch over you, too.

08:23.294 --> 08:26.756
Don't leave Kamigoe City
until we perform the exorcism.

08:26.839 --> 08:30.051
We won't be able to utilize
the barrier's power if you do.

08:30.134 --> 08:33.429
That, and Taro's barrier won't last long.

08:33.930 --> 08:38.309
An evil spirit at Evil Eye's level
can form resistance to barriers.

08:38.392 --> 08:40.895
Also, we'll have to use these.

08:41.604 --> 08:45.274
Everyone, make sure to keep
a hot water thermos on you.

08:45.358 --> 08:47.568
So you can splash him at any time.

08:51.572 --> 08:54.033
Jiji, I want you to be extra careful, too.

08:54.116 --> 08:56.452
When you wash your hands,
when you drink water,

08:56.536 --> 08:57.703
and on rainy days.

08:57.787 --> 09:01.749
Just a tiny bit of cold water
and you'll transform.

09:04.502 --> 09:07.213
It's time to murder all the humans.

09:10.633 --> 09:12.843
I never want to go through that again.

09:12.927 --> 09:14.262
Right.

09:16.514 --> 09:19.725
We have to do our best
until the exorcism is complete.

09:20.518 --> 09:22.645
Where're you gonna live, Mantisian?

09:22.728 --> 09:27.066
I decided to be a live-in worker
at a dairy farm nearby, deez.

09:27.149 --> 09:28.943
It's all thanks to Ms. Seiko, deez.

09:29.026 --> 09:31.112
Thanks for coming to help us out.

09:31.195 --> 09:34.699
If something happens,
please call for me again, deez.

09:35.199 --> 09:36.867
Um, Mr. Mantisian?

09:36.951 --> 09:38.744
How does that UFO fly?

09:38.828 --> 09:41.372
- An anti-gravity propulsion machine?
- So cute!

09:41.455 --> 09:43.791
It's [@@K], deez.

09:45.710 --> 09:48.004
By the way, Mantisian, what's your name?

09:48.087 --> 09:51.215
Let's see, by Terran pronunciation...

09:52.258 --> 09:54.093
It's Peeny Weeny, deez.

10:03.477 --> 10:05.229
Bye-bye, deez!

10:05.855 --> 10:07.440
See ya, Mantisian!

10:07.523 --> 10:09.984
Mr. Mantisian,
please let me ride it next time!

10:10.067 --> 10:13.112
Chiquitita, I'll see you again!
Shrimp can go home, though!

10:33.299 --> 10:35.426
More like, they're going home on the UFO?

10:35.509 --> 10:37.428
They're really close by, too.

10:39.221 --> 10:42.558
How long until we get to the hospital
that Jiji's parents are in?

10:42.642 --> 10:45.895
I had them transferred over here,
so about ten minutes.

10:45.978 --> 10:48.356
Taro, you're wearing
your clothes inside out.

10:48.439 --> 10:51.567
Shut up! Normally I prefer
to be buck naked.

10:51.651 --> 10:53.069
Got your thermoses?

10:53.152 --> 10:54.028
Got it!

10:54.111 --> 10:54.945
Hot water?

10:55.029 --> 10:55.863
In there!

10:55.946 --> 10:56.864
Okarun.

10:56.947 --> 10:57.823
Ready to go!

10:57.907 --> 10:58.949
Okay!

11:04.455 --> 11:05.956
I'm sorry.

11:06.040 --> 11:08.834
It's fine. You're worrying too much.

11:08.918 --> 11:10.628
Oh, okay.

11:11.504 --> 11:13.714
C'mon. Put your hand here.

11:14.715 --> 11:16.133
Okay.

11:53.838 --> 11:58.008
Um, Miss Ayase, what are you doing?

11:59.468 --> 12:02.388
What? I haven't been doing anything.

12:02.471 --> 12:07.852
Well, I mean your hand is...
I don't know the game or its rules, so...

12:07.935 --> 12:10.104
I don't know what you're talking about.

12:11.939 --> 12:15.526
Hey, Momo! Taro won't listen to me at all!

12:15.609 --> 12:17.111
Please, talk to him!

12:17.194 --> 12:18.362
Shut up!

12:18.446 --> 12:22.324
I can't move my body,
so Taro needs to move like I do!

12:22.408 --> 12:23.993
What a pain in the ass.

12:24.076 --> 12:26.328
Now, let's go! Ready...

12:27.538 --> 12:28.998
That's completely wrong!

12:29.081 --> 12:33.169
Like I'd know, moron! This is my body,
so I'll move however I want!

12:33.252 --> 12:38.090
More like was it okay
not getting a gift for Jiji's parents?

12:38.174 --> 12:40.301
Crap! Is there a supermarket nearby?

12:40.968 --> 12:42.261
WE HAVE EVERYTHING SUPERMARKET

12:42.845 --> 12:45.055
There's one near the hospital.

12:45.139 --> 12:46.223
A lifesaver!

12:46.807 --> 12:48.684
I hope they're getting better.

12:48.767 --> 12:53.272
They're always hyper and too rowdy,
so them being sick is just right.

12:53.355 --> 12:56.317
Isn't that a bit cold?
Are you trying to act tough?

12:56.400 --> 13:01.405
Of course not. Why would I?
I'm not that worried to begin with!

13:13.626 --> 13:15.961
I'm glad they look well.

13:16.045 --> 13:17.004
Yup!

13:17.588 --> 13:19.715
More like, why're you standing so still?

13:19.798 --> 13:22.259
Taro, make sure to react accordingly!

13:22.343 --> 13:25.387
You say that, but it's hard
to move just your body!

13:25.471 --> 13:26.639
Don't look away!

13:27.598 --> 13:29.350
Oh, now you did it!

13:29.433 --> 13:30.809
That's cringy.

13:30.893 --> 13:33.187
Give me my body back.

13:33.270 --> 13:35.856
...there are no casualties
as a result of this eruption.

13:35.940 --> 13:37.858
And according to the Weather Bureau,

13:37.942 --> 13:43.989
the wildfires have been contained,
but they will stay at alert level four.

13:44.949 --> 13:46.242
And the next news...

13:46.325 --> 13:49.411
Juichi Kito and nine others
living in Daija Town

13:49.495 --> 13:52.206
have been arrested with charges
of murder and illegal confinement.

13:52.289 --> 13:56.377
The suspected ringleader
Naki Kito, age unknown,

13:56.460 --> 14:00.839
is still on the run, and police
are seeking her whereabouts.

14:04.969 --> 14:06.178
Damn it.

14:12.393 --> 14:14.103
God damn it!

14:16.522 --> 14:20.818
I spent 200 years growing it that big!

14:40.379 --> 14:41.755
Damn it!

14:41.839 --> 14:43.674
Damn it!

14:45.593 --> 14:48.178
God damn it!

15:07.823 --> 15:11.994
You're not getting away with this,
Momo Ayase!

15:23.172 --> 15:28.844
You've turned all of us
Subterraneans into your enemy!

15:34.516 --> 15:36.477
Okarun!

15:40.147 --> 15:41.982
Let's go together!

15:43.192 --> 15:44.443
Miss Ayase.

15:44.526 --> 15:46.153
Good morning.

15:46.236 --> 15:48.489
How is Mr. Jiji doing?

15:48.572 --> 15:51.325
Oh, not good.

15:51.408 --> 15:53.953
It looks like Evil Eye
is getting used to the barrier.

15:54.036 --> 15:56.747
When will you be able to go through
with the exorcism thing?

15:56.830 --> 16:00.125
I don't know.
It doesn't seem like an ordinary exorcism.

16:00.209 --> 16:02.920
You know those hayashi performances
at festivals, right?

16:18.978 --> 16:23.732
They wanna do that to entertain Evil Eye
so it'll be easier to pull him out.

16:23.816 --> 16:24.984
I see.

16:25.067 --> 16:28.862
But apparently, nobody is willing
to actually perform the hayashi.

16:30.572 --> 16:35.119
Then, when Taro's barrier no longer works,
we have to go against Evil Eye again?

16:35.202 --> 16:37.579
We'll have to hold him down.

16:38.205 --> 16:41.625
And so, there's something
I want to ask you, Okarun.

16:42.543 --> 16:43.669
What is it?

16:44.795 --> 16:46.005
Hey.

16:46.797 --> 16:48.674
Where's Jiji? He's not with you?

16:48.757 --> 16:51.677
Miko! Seeing your face calms me down.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.095
What's with you?

16:53.178 --> 16:56.056
I've returned to reality!

16:56.140 --> 16:58.726
More like, wasn't that volcano wicked?

16:59.476 --> 17:00.978
Did you see that eruption?

17:01.061 --> 17:04.314
Sorry, I don't wanna talk
about that right now.

17:04.398 --> 17:07.317
Huh? Why?
I thought you'd like stuff like that.

17:07.401 --> 17:08.235
I mean, look at this!

17:08.318 --> 17:10.946
There was a UFO sighting near the volcano!

17:11.030 --> 17:12.990
Huh? What about the giant earthworm?

17:13.073 --> 17:14.658
What's that? An alien?

17:16.368 --> 17:18.954
Like, why don't you
buy a smartphone already?

17:19.038 --> 17:20.622
I can't contact you at all!

17:20.706 --> 17:22.291
Don't got any dough.

17:22.374 --> 17:27.713
Grandma buys me uniforms and stuff,
but she won't shell out for a smartphone.

17:35.262 --> 17:37.389
I'm the one who spread that fake rumor.

17:37.473 --> 17:39.933
So please don't speak badly of Momo Ayase.

17:46.482 --> 17:48.567
Hey, Aira.

17:48.650 --> 17:50.486
Come hang out with me for a bit.

17:50.569 --> 17:52.446
What is it, Miss Ayase?

17:52.529 --> 17:55.657
Come on now, quit the terrible acting.
Just come on over here.

17:55.741 --> 17:58.744
Hold on, let me go!
What are you going to do?

17:58.827 --> 18:01.497
Shut up! Quit yer whining and come here!

18:01.580 --> 18:02.623
- This way, come on!
- No!

18:02.706 --> 18:04.583
Do you want to die?

18:04.666 --> 18:07.669
Stop being all chummy with me
in front of my entire class!

18:07.753 --> 18:10.672
There she is. That's the Aira I know.

18:11.298 --> 18:14.760
Just being friendly with the likes of you
drops my popularity.

18:14.843 --> 18:19.431
You're different, Takakura.
I'm glad you spoke to me.

18:19.515 --> 18:21.558
So, what do you want to talk about?

18:23.560 --> 18:27.272
So, yeah. Okarun and Aira.

18:27.356 --> 18:29.817
I want both of you
to sleep over at my place.

18:31.235 --> 18:35.531
I'd feel reassured if you two were around
if Jiji turns back into Evil Eye.

18:35.614 --> 18:37.950
Of course Grandma is with me,

18:38.033 --> 18:40.410
but it's not like
she can watch over him 24 hours a day.

18:40.494 --> 18:45.666
Right now, while I'm at school,
Manjiro is helping her take care of Jiji.

18:45.749 --> 18:48.377
So I'd like them to rest
as much as they can at night.

18:50.003 --> 18:53.006
Well, we really have no choice about this.

18:53.090 --> 18:54.550
Really, no choice.

18:54.633 --> 18:58.679
This is absolutely the worst.
I mean, gosh. It makes me sick!

18:58.762 --> 19:03.308
We really can't do anything about it.
I guess I'll have to go.

19:03.392 --> 19:08.522
Why did it end up this way?
This is really the pits! Man, I hate it!

19:08.605 --> 19:09.940
If you can't, you don't have to--

19:10.023 --> 19:11.108
We'll sleepover!

19:11.191 --> 19:14.111
All right! How about starting tonight?

19:14.194 --> 19:16.822
Tonight? Geez, what should I do?

19:17.406 --> 19:20.367
If you have plans with your friends,
you can come over anytime after.

19:21.243 --> 19:24.079
I don't have plans like that.

19:25.789 --> 19:28.709
If you got beef
with your friends because of me,

19:28.792 --> 19:31.503
you don't have to force yourself
to hang with us.

19:32.337 --> 19:35.299
Why're you telling me things like that?

19:36.008 --> 19:40.596
You don't have anything to do with this,
and it's all my fault, anyway.

19:43.140 --> 19:44.433
Oh, an arm fell off.

19:45.017 --> 19:48.228
Auntie, what should I do?
There's smoke coming out, too!

19:52.524 --> 19:54.067
I guess it's finally time.

19:54.151 --> 19:56.653
Taro, you can release yourself now.

19:56.737 --> 19:58.238
Great job.

20:01.033 --> 20:02.159
Yow.

20:02.242 --> 20:05.204
Man, that was rough.

20:05.287 --> 20:07.789
Thank you, Taro. You're a lifesaver!

20:07.873 --> 20:10.918
- Jiji, from here, we have no aid.
- Okay, stand! This way!

20:11.001 --> 20:13.503
You need to be careful of water
more than ever before.

20:13.587 --> 20:15.547
Make sure to wash your hands
with hot water.

20:15.631 --> 20:16.757
Yes'm!

20:16.840 --> 20:18.842
Stop! Ouch!

20:19.384 --> 20:21.803
- I'm home!
- Oh, perfect timing.

20:21.887 --> 20:23.805
I brought everyone over.

20:23.889 --> 20:25.515
Pardon me.

20:25.599 --> 20:28.268
Okarun! I missed you!

20:28.352 --> 20:29.728
Looks like you're doing well.

20:29.811 --> 20:33.732
- This way, over here! This way!
- Huh? Taro's not on you.

20:35.734 --> 20:38.987
Oh, this is the pits.
I'm really sick of it.

20:39.071 --> 20:43.075
Aira-chan! You're such a cutie as always!

20:43.158 --> 20:45.244
Thanks. Can you carry my stuff?

20:45.327 --> 20:47.120
Cutie, you're such a cutie!

20:47.204 --> 20:48.830
Taro, are you all right?

20:48.914 --> 20:50.040
Hey, Momo.

20:50.123 --> 20:52.334
Hey, where do I hang my coat?

20:52.417 --> 20:55.462
Every last one of you, carry a thermos.

20:55.545 --> 20:58.298
When Jiji transforms,
splash hot water right away.

20:58.382 --> 20:59.800
I'll take the red one.

20:59.883 --> 21:00.717
Momo!

21:00.801 --> 21:03.553
And we're gonna eat now,
so get the table out.

21:04.554 --> 21:06.348
Taro, are you okay?

21:06.431 --> 21:08.684
I'm going to rest for a little bit.

21:08.767 --> 21:12.437
Hey, Momo, where did you put
my fluffy cushion?

21:12.521 --> 21:13.939
Hell if I know.

21:14.022 --> 21:16.817
Mr. Jiji, how are you faring physically?

21:24.574 --> 21:26.618
Time to eat!

21:27.202 --> 21:29.538
What toner do you usually use?

21:29.621 --> 21:32.165
- SKK Gold Experience.
- Looks tasty!

21:32.249 --> 21:34.626
Pricey! Can I try some later?

21:34.710 --> 21:37.212
- Let's play Smash Bruh later.
- What about your moisturizing milk?

21:37.296 --> 21:39.339
- Same brand.
- I'm really good at it.

21:39.423 --> 21:42.259
All right. Why don't we all
play it together, then?

21:42.342 --> 21:45.095
Momo, my fluffy cushion...

21:45.178 --> 21:46.972
I said, hell if I know.

21:47.055 --> 21:49.433
Hey, Four-Eyes. Pass the soy sauce.

21:50.017 --> 21:51.184
Oh, sure.

21:53.603 --> 21:56.648
SAUCE

21:58.650 --> 22:00.402
Not that one.

22:00.485 --> 22:01.987
Oh, right.

22:02.654 --> 22:05.532
SAUCE

22:07.451 --> 22:10.412
SOY SAUCE

23:53.473 --> 23:56.226
- Sleepovers equal love stories, right?
- You mean ghost stories.

23:56.309 --> 23:57.477
- I'll go first.
- Listen to me.

23:57.561 --> 23:59.563
If we're talking love,
then it's Takakura, and then...

23:59.646 --> 24:00.564
A ghost story?

24:00.647 --> 24:02.023
You've heard that ghosts

24:02.107 --> 24:04.693
tend to gather by the waterside,
and impure ghosts yearn for dryness.

24:04.776 --> 24:06.361
Wow, you're so smart!

24:06.444 --> 24:07.946
So annoying.
